		Heading 1:
			Text: Margin merging
		Paragraph: Two vertical margins that touch are not added: the larger one is kept. With 10 below the first box and 30 above the second, they are 30 apart. The top margin of a first child comes out of a parent without border or padding on that side.
			Style: intro
		Text: Margin: 0 0 10 0, then Margin: 30 0 0 0
			Style: label
		Block:
			Style: sample
			Text: Bottom margin 10
				Style: piece
				Box:
					Margin: 0 0 10 0
			Text: Top margin 30: the gap is 30, not 40
				Style: piece
				Box:
					Margin: 30 0 0 0
		Text: A negative margin: Margin: -4 0 0 0 after Margin: 0 0 20 0
			Style: label
		Block:
			Style: sample
